==Description==
The '''Frozen Solid Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 21 of the premium [[The Final Act Event#The Final Act Battle Pass|The Final Act Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{PlushieSnowman|655}} or {{Robux|72}} ({{Robux|57}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{PlushieSnowman|6,370}} or {{Robux|1,857}} ({{Robux|1,477}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale).

It is the same as [[Frozen Nametag]]. It has blue text, dark blue outline and a shining translucent blue background. It also emits white particles.

